YouTube Extended for webOS — unofficial modified fork

Modified by Mahesh Vanga, 1–2 November 2026.
Version 0.5.6 adds the transparent Green-button settings panel, sleep timer,
video details, panel transparency and live SponsorBlock toggle handling.
It retains the earlier video framing/zoom, native HDR preference and playback fixes.

Based on webosbrew/youtube-webos and its contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/webosbrew/youtube-webos
